[p]Hey everyone!

[b]The 20th June release of Drug Dealer Simulator[/b] will come with a day one update that will bring the improvements below. These will be added to the Xbox version with a later update, most likely in a couple of weeks.

- Autosave upon entering and exiting hideouts, with a 5-minut cooldown;
- "Drug Sense" under D-pad left, which highlights nearby interactive objects;
- Editorial and proofreading changes in English and Polish texts;
- Improved UI layout readibility;
- Tab switching on the phone will utilize L1 and R2 buttons;
- Taking or cancelling incoming calls will also utilize L1 and R2;
- New "Story So Far" option in the main menu to better explain the game's setting and story;
- Fixed issues related to improper functioning of certain UI elements;
- Reducing the darkness during night;
- Fixed issues with certain buttons not being clickable or accessible in the UI;
- Accepting sales and purchasing items can be done by holding the triangle button.

Additionally, the PS5 version will launch with certain improvements without requiring the day one update, which will also come to the Xbox version at a later date:

- Changes in controls layout for easier backpack ejecting, hiding the phone, or opening the map;
- Possibility to interact with an NPC while holding the phone. By performing such an action, the character will automatically hide the phone;
- When the player jumps over the fence while holding the phone after performing this action, the character will pull out the phone again, as well as light the flashlight if it was on;
- Various UI improvements for better usability and aesthetic;
- Improved informing about certain action so the player avoids unwanted consequences;
- Saving the game will be possible after the first conversation on the phone with Eddie.

Cheers!   [/p]

Hello there!

Our publisher, Movie Games, has the pleasure to announce a new game from the producers behind Drug Dealer Simulator. Say hi to a [b]first-person simulator[/b] game with RPG elements inspired by [b]Thief and Shawshank Redemption[/b], Prison King!

[previewyoutube=KO8GlZS38Bs;full][/previewyoutube]

Sentenced for innocence… And now you need to learn how to survive. Navigate the prison life, make deals with guards and gangs alike, manage and sell contraband, and plot your next move. Your goal: to get out.

[b]Features:[/b]
[list][*]Manage and sell contraband to other prisoners;
[*]Make deals with both prison gangs and guards;
[*]Collect valuable intel;
[*]Customise your prison cell;
[*]Collect proof of your innocence or plot a daring prison break and unlock different endings.[/list]

Deal your way out of prison! Wishlist Prison King now ⬇

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1897030/Prison_King/

